  "id": "habit-strength",
  "term": "habit strength",
  "definition": "Habit strength is the degree to which a consumption behavior is established as a habit, often reflected in how frequently a person does it. In this context, stronger habit strength was treated as an important source of differences in current consumption and in how people respond to warning labels.",
